# Surfpool
.surfpool/
# txtx.yml + runbooks/ are committed: surfpool auto-runs the `deployment`
# runbook on startup to deploy the workspace programs onto the fork, so CI needs
# them. The subgraph runbook is a local-only introspection aid (needs the studio
# subgraph service) and is not required by the fork tests.
